+
+## Request
+
+Three reports:
+1. Percentage coupon was computed on the gross amount instead of the subtotal after volume discounts (12 × €5.00, 10% coupon: expected €48.60). Fixed in `src/pricing.ts`.
+2. Coupon AUTUMN refused on its last day (30 November). The last day is included; fixed in `src/coupons.ts` (`redeemable`).
+3. Remove VAT on shipping: NOT done. README (authoritative) says shipping is subject to 22% VAT, shown on its own receipt line. Needs a business/README decision.
+
+Tests added in `test/coupons.test.ts`; `npm test` passes (19 tests).
